{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Sebastian made <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> bracelets on Tuesday, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> bracelets on Thursday, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> bracelets on Saturday. How many bracelets did he make in total?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all three days, he made <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b18b6a037699805652cd577bb6946e47fc02814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 4 + N = N + 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"153\" height=\"16\" /> bracelets in total.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1\">player 1</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f5ac0a3d3006b0c7884d0480e7b532a088b1525.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, he made <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84a5cc4789f67e37b9400a96931474a1543d8dbe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N + 9 = 11 + 9 = \\boxed{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"177\" height=\"25\" /> bracelets in total.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1\">Practice Relay Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3\">Practice Relay Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" s